model {
  extend basalt.pool {
    metadata {
      constraint "Once a UTC day after the allowance refresh, the pool reports each plan whose last usable row expires within 7 days as its own error event on the existing monitoring path, naming only public plan identities. A day counts only after delivery. A refused delivery waits for the retry time the observability adapter names for error events, in its rate-limit header or Retry-After, and at least 30 minutes, before the report is sent or the registry read again; the alert's own record keeps when refusals began and the adapter's last status, which the controller inspect returns."
    }
  }
}
